{%- comment -%}
  FUEL_06 product page entry (2026-09-30). A decorated link under the buy
  button that opens the finder dialog which sections/feature-highlights.liquid
  renders on product templates (mode 'dialog' of snippets/fuel06-finder.liquid).

  Ships with the hidden attribute: assets/fuel06-finder.js drops it once the
  dialog is on the page, and assets/fuel06-finder.css shows the link only when
  Intelligems puts ab-f06-finder on the html element (or in the theme editor),
  so the control version and any template without the dialog never show it.

  Rendered from snippets/reactive-variant-selector.liquid, right after the add to
  cart form and before the payment badge (the perfume templates disable the
  theme's own buy_buttons block and draw the button there).
  Remove this file and that render line with the FUEL_06 cleanup.
{%- endcomment -%}
<button type="button" class="fuel06-pdp-link" data-f06-open-external hidden>
  <span class="fuel06-pdp-link__icon" aria-hidden="true">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.25" stroke-linejoin="round" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" focusable="false"><path transform="translate(1.668 1.672)" d="M5 10.833C9.063 10.833 10.833 9.124 10.833 5C10.833 9.124 12.592 10.833 16.667 10.833C12.592 10.833 10.833 12.592 10.833 16.667C10.833 12.592 9.063 10.833 5 10.833ZM0 3.75C2.612 3.75 3.75 2.652 3.75 0C3.75 2.652 4.881 3.75 7.5 3.75C4.881 3.75 3.75 4.881 3.75 7.5C3.75 4.881 2.612 3.75 0 3.75Z"/></svg>
  </span>
  {%- comment -%} The arrow sits inside the text, glued to the last word, so it follows it when the line wraps on phones. {%- endcomment -%}
  <span class="fuel06-pdp-link__text">Inte din doft? <em>Hitta din designerdoft för mindre</em>&nbsp;<span class="fuel06-pdp-link__arrow" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></span>
</button>
